&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shadrunov/rssfy-telegram/main/feeds/media/mlaylala_spricht/1235.jpg" alt="Photo" style="max-width:100%;"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
